cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software when using the analyses or figure source data."
type: software
title: "Single-cell wound measurement and population dynamics"
authors:
  - family-names: Fu
    given-names: Zeyu
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Reproducible analyses of cell-state abundance, patient-level measurement
  validity, and held-out population dynamics in public wound single-cell data.
  The software accompanies two methodological studies and does not constitute
  a clinically validated prognostic tool.
keywords:
  - single-cell transcriptomics
  - wound healing
  - measurement validity
  - patient-level inference
  - conditional flow matching
repository-code: https://github.com/PeterPonyu/single-cell-wound-analysis
